# Deploy-only template for MULTICA_TASK_NOTIFY_* (SCS fork).
#
# Preferred: configure channels in the UI —
#   Settings → Integrations → Messaging → 任务结束推送
#   (WeChat URL and/or WeChat ClawBot token)
#
# MULTICA_TASK_NOTIFY_URL remains a legacy fallback for the WeChat URL channel
# when the workspace has not set wechat_url yet. Empty = no env fallback.
#
# MULTICA_TASK_NOTIFY_URL=https://YOUR-WX-SEND-HOST/wxsend
# MULTICA_TASK_NOTIFY_APP_URL=https://your-public-multica-origin
